## the forward alone (prototype with no rewrite) costs the guest nothing: its fuel equals main's
norewrite 16255056 {0: 12, 17: 48}
main 16255056 {0: 7, 17: 53}
## and with the trampoline's instructions let through (not the design): 11 more
norestore 16254709 {0: 60}
none 16254698 {0: 60}
